    "nodes": [
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## CHEFS Event Subscription sample\n\n**CHEFS -> Manage Form -> Event Subscription**\n- Endpoint URL: `https://workflow.digital.gov.bc.ca/rest/custom/v1/chefs/trip-plan`\n- Key: `x-n8n-chef-key`\n- Endpoint Token: the secret stored in your Header Auth credential\n\nThe last path segment (`trip-plan`) must equal the **Path** of the Webhook node.\n\n**Before activating**\n1. Select a *Header Auth* credential (Name `x-n8n-chef-key`, Value = Endpoint Token) on **CHEFS Event** and **CHEFS Resubmit Wait**.\n2. Select a *CHEFS Form Authentication* credential on both extractor nodes.\n3. Select a *Workflow Interaction Layer API* credential on **Reviewer Decision**.\n4. Select an SMTP credential on the two email nodes and replace the field names under `submission.data.*` with your form's field API names.",
          "height": 520,
          "width": 460,
          "color": 4
        },
        "id": "0b0f3f2e-6a8b-4d55-9a51-6f0f6c0a0001",
        "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [-520, -260]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Resubmission loop\n\n**CHEFS Resubmit Wait** registers `(formId, submissionId) -> resumeUrl` with external-hooks and pauses.\n\nThe submitter opens the view link, clicks **Recall Submission**, edits and submits. CHEFS sends `eventSubmission` for the **same** submissionId to `/rest/custom/v1/chefs/trip-plan`; external-hooks finds the registration and forwards the call to this execution's resume URL instead of starting a new execution.\n\nCHEFS only sends the event on **Submit**, never on a draft save, so **Re-extract Submission** reads the resubmitted (non-draft) data.",
          "height": 400,
          "width": 460,
          "color": 6
        },
        "id": "0b0f3f2e-6a8b-4d55-9a51-6f0f6c0a0002",
        "name": "Sticky Note - Resubmission",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [1440, 380]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "httpMethod": "POST",
          "path": "trip-plan",
          "authentication": "headerAuth",
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "0b0f3f2e-6a8b-4d55-9a51-6f0f6c0a0010",
        "name": "CHEFS Event",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
        "typeVersion": 2.1,
        "position": [0, 0],
        "webhookId": "5d0c1d6e-1f43-4c3e-9a6b-0c7e2d1a0010"
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "submissionId": "={{ $json.body.submissionId }}",
          "fieldMappingMode": "fullSubmission"
        },
        "id": "0b0f3f2e-6a8b-4d55-9a51-6f0f6c0a0011",
        "name": "Extract Submission",
        "type": "CUSTOM.chefsSubmissionExtractor",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [220, 0]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "assignments": {
            "assignments": [
              {
                "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
